{"seq":3,"slug":"nuclear-hydrogen","title":"核能与氢能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/nuclear-hydrogen","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-nuclear-fission","title":"先进核裂变技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/nuclear-hydrogen/advanced-nuclear-fission","wordCount":1946,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"small-modular-reactors","title":"小型模块化反应堆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/nuclear-hydrogen/small-modular-reactors","wordCount":1785,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"hydrogen-economy","title":"氢能经济体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/nuclear-hydrogen/hydrogen-economy","wordCount":1852,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核能与氢能\">核能与氢能</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>核能提供稳定的零碳基荷电力，氢能则是实现难以电气化领域（重工业、远洋航运、航空）脱碳的关键载体。本章覆盖先进核裂变技术、小型模块化反应堆，以及氢能经济的全链条（制取-储运-应用）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>先进核裂变技术</td>\n<td>Gen III+运行实绩、Gen IV堆型（钠冷快堆/高温气冷堆/熔盐堆）研发现状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>小型模块化反应堆</td>\n<td>SMR设计理念、主要堆型、工厂化制造、经济性分析与监管路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>氢能经济体系</td>\n<td>绿氢/蓝氢制取路线、电解槽技术、储运方案、燃料电池与成本曲线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>SMR（Small Modular Reactor）</strong>：功率≤300MWe的模块化核反应堆</li>\n<li><strong>绿氢（Green Hydrogen）</strong>：使用可再生电力电解水制取的氢气</li>\n<li><strong>PEM 电解槽</strong>：质子交换膜电解水技术，响应速度快，适配波动性可再生能源</li>\n</ul>\n"}